{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"The treaty rate is **15%** on US-source dividends paid to the Irish UCITS ETF, assuming it qualifies for treaty benefits and satisfies the limitation-on-benefits provisions. The **ETF bears the withholding**: it is deducted at source from the dividend by the US payer or custodian, reducing the fund’s net assets and returns. Investors generally do not separately pay this US withholding; they bear its economic effect through the ETF’s performance."}}
